{"availability":"available","full":"salwtf/OpenBrowser","name":"OpenBrowser","description":"Manage isolated Chromium browser profiles with proxy support, window synchronization, and local RPA automation.","category":"Developer tools","language":null,"stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-21T08:53:14Z","updated":"2026-10-11T07:38:25Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://salwtf.github.io","topics":["agent","agent-skills","agent-tools","agentic-browser","agents","ai","ai-browser","ai-browser-automation","automation","browseruse","chrome","chromium-browser","claude-code","claude-code-skills","comet","dia","openbrowser","openclaw","playwright","pwa"],"demo":"https://salwtf.github.io/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:01.981Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:01.981Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:01.981Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:01.981Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["OpenBrowser is a tool for managing multiple online profiles on your Windows computer. Each profile works as a separate browser environment. This keeps your activity, cookies, and login sessions isolated from one another. You can assign unique proxies to every profile and manage digital fingerprints to keep your identity secure. It also supports task automation to save you time."],"features":["OpenBrowser helps you manage complex web tasks through a simple interface.","Each profile behaves like a distinct computer. Websites cannot see data from your other profiles. This prevents tracking and keeps your personal and work accounts separate.","Integrate your proxy services directly into the browser. You can assign a specific proxy to each profile. The browser routes traffic through that address, protecting your real location. Use different proxies to browse…","Websites collect data about your computer to build a digital fingerprint. OpenBrowser lets you customize these traits. You can adjust your browser header, font lists, and screen resolution. This hides your actual…","The built-in automation tool handles repetitive actions. You can record clicks and keyboard inputs to perform tasks automatically. This feature helps you manage data entry, site navigation, or content updates without…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/salwtf/OpenBrowser/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9fdc77470e96be762e0c40b9e78377fd4c7819c224dc69c9abb27713cf2e1bf6","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:02.098Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:02.098Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"OpenBrowser is a tool for managing multiple online profiles on your Windows computer. Each profile works as a separate browser environment. This keeps your activity, cookies, and login sessions isolated from one another. You can assign unique proxies to every profile and manage digital fingerprints to keep your identity secure. It also supports task automation to save you time.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/salwtf/OpenBrowser/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"This keeps your activity, cookies, and login sessions isolated from one another.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/salwtf/OpenBrowser/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Log in to your account on any machine to access your saved proxies and profile identities.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/salwtf/OpenBrowser/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"9fdc77470e96be762e0c40b9e78377fd4c7819c224dc69c9abb27713cf2e1bf6","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/salwtf/OpenBrowser/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:02.098Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T07:38:25Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/salwtf/OpenBrowser/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:02.099Z","hash":"9fdc77470e96be762e0c40b9e78377fd4c7819c224dc69c9abb27713cf2e1bf6","originalBytes":4749,"storedBytes":4749